OL,3,ATogo charges two French journalists
OL,4,Aover incorrect documents, rights group
OL,5,Asays
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe two French journalists detained in
OL,8,FTogo since last month have been charged
OL,9,Fwith "false declarations" despite
OL,10,Fhaving the correct documents to work
OL,11,Fthere, Reporters Without Borders (RSF)
OL,12,Fhas said.
OL,14,FGael Mocaer and Sebastian Perez Pezzani
OL,15,Fhad been filming a documentary in Kara,
OL,16,Fnorthern Togo, for France Televisions
OL,17,Fwhen they were arrested on 27 July, the
OL,18,Fmedia rights group said, despite having
OL,19,Fwork visas and authorisation to film
OL,20,Fthere.
OL,23,APub: 20-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
