OL,3,ATogo charges two French journalists
OL,4,Aover incorrect documents, rights group
OL,5,Asays
OL,6,
OL,7,FFrance's foreign ministry confirmed the
OL,8,Fpair's detention, adding that they had
OL,9,Fbeen visited by French officials three
OL,10,Ftimes. Togolese authorities have yet to
OL,11,Fcomment.
OL,13,FTogo has faced criticism for clamping
OL,14,Fdown on free speech, with several
OL,15,Fforeign journalists detained in recent
OL,16,Fyears.
OL,23,APub: 20-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
